      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-01",
          "content": "我难以记住较长的指令。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-02",
          "content": "在一项活动进行到一半时，我有时难以记住自己正在做什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-03",
          "content": "我往往会不先考虑可能发生什么就直接做事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-04",
          "content": "即使别人告诉我不可以，我有时仍难以阻止自己做喜欢的事情。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-05",
          "content": "别人让我做几件事时，我有时只记得第一件或最后一件。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-06",
          "content": "在不合适的场合，我有时难以忍住不微笑或大笑。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-07",
          "content": "遇到困难时，我难以想出另一种解决问题的方法。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-08",
          "content": "别人让我去拿某样东西时，我有时会忘记自己应该拿什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-09",
          "content": "我难以为一项活动做计划（例如出行、上班或上学时记得带齐所需物品）。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-10",
          "content": "我有时难以停止喜欢的活动（例如晚上到了该睡觉的时间，我仍看电视或坐在电脑前）。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-11",
          "content": "除非同时有人示范，否则我有时难以理解口头指令。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-12",
          "content": "涉及多个步骤的任务或活动对我来说比较困难。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-13",
          "content": "我难以提前思考或从经验中学习。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 12,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "ADEXI-14",
          "content": "我遇到的人有时似乎认为，与同龄人相比，我更活跃或更“野”。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 13,
          "responseSetKey": "adexi_frequency_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
